<section class="ch" id="opportunity"><div class="shell">
 <div class="ch-txt head"><p class="lab">The opportunity</p><h2 class="claim">Small businesses wait weeks for a loan. Many never get one.</h2>
 <p>In the UAE, small and medium businesses are most of the market but get only a small share of bank credit.</p></div>
 <ol class="ins">
  <li><span class="iq">Banks see small businesses as high risk.</span><p>So loans are hard to get: a long track record, a long review, and many businesses are turned down.</p></li>
  <li><span class="iq">Applying takes weeks.</span><p>Branch visits, paper documents and manual checks, before anyone says yes or no.</p></li>
  <li><span class="iq">Traders need the money now.</span><p>They borrow to buy stock. If the money arrives too late, the deal is gone.</p></li>
 </ol>
 <div class="wide-m"><div class="opts-box"><div class="tl" role="img" aria-label="On the same time scale, a bank loan takes weeks and a QFunder loan takes one day">
 <div class="tl-axis"><span>Day 1</span><span>Week 1</span><span>Week 2</span><span>Week 3</span><span>Week 4</span></div>
 <div class="tl-row"><p class="tl-l">At a bank</p><div class="tl-track"><div class="tl-bar old" style="--w:100%"><i><span>Branch visit</span></i><i><span>Paper documents</span></i><i><span>Manual checks</span></i><i><span>Decision</span></i></div></div><b class="tl-v">Up to 4 weeks</b></div>
 <div class="tl-row"><p class="tl-l">With QFunder</p><div class="tl-track"><div class="tl-bar new" style="--w:3.6%"></div><span class="tl-tag">Apply, verify, decide, fund</span></div><b class="tl-v acc">24 hours</b></div>
</div></div></div>

</div></section><section class="bigq" id="challenge"><div class="shell"><blockquote>How do you design a loan that is safe enough to approve, but fast enough to fund in 24 hours?</blockquote></div></section><section class="ch" id="strategy" data-v="b"><div class="shell">
 <div class="ch-txt head"><p class="lab">Product strategy</p><h2 class="claim">Two months to test the idea. So we took out every manual check.</h2>
 <p>Manual checks were what stood between a business and its money. I pushed for automating every one of them for the MVP.</p></div>
 <div class="decs">
 <article class="dec"><div class="dec-txt"><span class="dn">01</span><h3>No paperwork for Tradeling customers.</h3><p>Tradeling already had their trade licence and company details. I made sure QFunder was connected to that data, so existing customers did not upload anything again.</p></div><div class="dec-m"><div class="scene flw fb1" data-scene data-max="5" role="img" aria-label="Trade licence, company, owner and contact details move from the Tradeling account into the QFunder application. Nothing to upload."><div class="fl-node src"><p>Tradeling account</p><span>already on file</span></div><i class="fl-ghost" style="--k:0"></i><i class="fl-ghost" style="--k:1"></i><i class="fl-ghost" style="--k:2"></i><i class="fl-ghost" style="--k:3"></i><i class="fl-link"></i><div class="fl-node dst" data-at="5"><p>QFunder application</p><span class="fl-done"><i class="tick"></i>Nothing to upload</span></div><span class="fl-chip" data-at="1" style="--k:0">Trade licence</span><span class="fl-chip" data-at="2" style="--k:1">Company</span><span class="fl-chip" data-at="3" style="--k:2">Owner</span><span class="fl-chip" data-at="4" style="--k:3">Contact</span></div></div></article>
 <article class="dec"><div class="dec-txt"><span class="dn">02</span><h3>Digital KYC and KYB for everyone else.</h3><p>New businesses verify the owner and the trade licence online, with Shufti Pro. No typing details in, and no waiting for someone to look.</p></div><div class="dec-m"><div class="scene flw fb2" data-scene data-max="4" role="img" aria-label="Emirates ID, passport and trade licence each connect to one check; when all three pass, the business is verified"><svg class="fl-svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path data-at="1" pathLength="1" d="M40 27 C 52 27, 50 50, 64 50"/><path data-at="2" pathLength="1" d="M40 50 C 52 50, 50 50, 64 50"/><path data-at="3" pathLength="1" d="M40 73 C 52 73, 50 50, 64 50"/></svg><span class="fl-doc" data-at="1" style="--k:0"><b>Emirates ID</b><em>owner</em></span><span class="fl-doc" data-at="2" style="--k:1"><b>Passport</b><em>owner</em></span><span class="fl-doc" data-at="3" style="--k:2"><b>Trade licence</b><em>business</em></span><div class="fl-ring" data-at="4"><svg viewBox="0 0 36 36" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="15"/><circle class="arc" cx="18" cy="18" r="15"/></svg><span class="r-a">Checking</span><span class="r-b"><i class="tick"></i>Verified</span></div></div></div></article>
 <article class="dec"><div class="dec-txt"><span class="dn">03</span><h3>Bank statements summarised for underwriting.</h3><p>Underwriting looks at two things: the business’s credit score from the bureau, and its bank statements. Reading the statements by hand was the slow part.</p><p>We built a system that reads the statement, summarises it and scores it. Underwriters now decide from the bureau score and one summary, instead of a stack of paper.</p></div><div class="dec-m"><div class="scene flw fb3" data-scene data-max="5" role="img" aria-label="Lines of the bank statement feed income, spending and balance, which become a statement score, ready for underwriting"><div class="fl-stmt"><p>Bank statement</p><i style="--w:70%"></i><i style="--w:52%"></i><i style="--w:64%"></i><i style="--w:44%"></i><i style="--w:76%"></i><i style="--w:58%"></i><i style="--w:66%"></i><i style="--w:48%"></i></div><svg class="fl-svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path data-at="1" pathLength="1" d="M41 50 C 49 50, 48 20, 55.5 20"/><path data-at="2" pathLength="1" d="M41 50 C 49 50, 48 34, 55.5 34"/><path data-at="3" pathLength="1" d="M41 50 C 49 50, 48 48, 55.5 48"/></svg><span class="fl-out" data-at="1" style="--k:0"><b>Income</b><u style="--w:78%"></u></span><span class="fl-out" data-at="2" style="--k:1"><b>Spending</b><u style="--w:52%"></u></span><span class="fl-out" data-at="3" style="--k:2"><b>Balance</b><u style="--w:64%"></u></span><div class="fl-score" data-at="4"><svg viewBox="0 0 36 36" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="15"/><circle class="arc" cx="18" cy="18" r="15"/></svg><span>Statement score</span></div><span class="fl-ready" data-at="5"><span class="res">Ready for underwriting</span></span></div></div></article>
 </div>
</div></section><section class="ch" id="design"><div class="shell">
 <div class="ch-txt head"><p class="lab">The design</p><h2 class="claim">Built to earn trust, and to move fast.</h2></div>

 <div class="journey">
 <article class="jstep" id="step-1"><div class="js-txt"><h3>Trust comes first.</h3><p>For a new lender, trust is everything. I kept the page institutional but easy to read: no jargon, three clear promises (fast, simple, secure) and a loan calculator that shows the monthly payment before a business signs up.</p></div><div class="js-m"><div class="qf-win qf-land"><div class="qf-bar"><span class="qf-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="qf-url"><svg viewBox="0 0 10 12" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1" y="5" width="8" height="6.5" rx="1.4" fill="#3c3c43"/><path d="M3 5V3.6a2 2 0 0 1 4 0V5" fill="none" stroke="#3c3c43" stroke-width="1.3"/></svg>qfunder.tradeling.com</span><span></span></div><div class="qf-vp qf-sc"><img src="/work/qfunder/i/58ac43ce223a.jpg" alt="The QFunder landing page"></div></div></div></article>
 <article class="jstep" id="step-2"><div class="js-txt"><h3>Easy to finish, hard to fake.</h3><p>Make onboarding too hard and businesses drop off. Make it too easy and we risk fraud. I broke one long form into short steps, with KYC verified instantly.</p></div><div class="js-m"><div class="qo"><div class="qf-win " data-vw="1520" data-vh="950"><div class="qf-bar"><span class="qf-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="qf-url"><svg viewBox="0 0 10 12" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1" y="5" width="8" height="6.5" rx="1.4" fill="#3c3c43"/><path d="M3 5V3.6a2 2 0 0 1 4 0V5" fill="none" stroke="#3c3c43" stroke-width="1.3"/></svg>qfunder.tradeling.com</span><span></span></div><div class="qf-vp"><div class="qf-pg"></div></div></div></div></div></article>
 <article class="jstep" id="step-3"><div class="js-txt"><h3>Apply in 3–5 minutes.</h3><p>Simple enough to finish in 3–5 minutes. I removed the extra steps banks ask for out of habit and kept only the essential data.</p></div><div class="js-m"><div class="qf-win qf-app" data-vw="1280" data-vh="800"><div class="qf-bar"><span class="qf-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="qf-url"><svg viewBox="0 0 10 12" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1" y="5" width="8" height="6.5" rx="1.4" fill="#3c3c43"/><path d="M3 5V3.6a2 2 0 0 1 4 0V5" fill="none" stroke="#3c3c43" stroke-width="1.3"/></svg>qfunder.tradeling.com</span><span></span></div><div class="qf-vp"><div class="qf-pg"></div></div></div></div></article>
 <article class="jstep" id="step-4"><div class="js-txt"><h3>Never in the dark.</h3><p>A business sees its repayment schedule, its next payment and its payment history, and can pay from the same place. It always knows what it owes, so it can plan its cash flow.</p></div><div class="js-m"><div class="qf-win qf-dash" data-vw="1280" data-vh="800"><div class="qf-bar"><span class="qf-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="qf-url"><svg viewBox="0 0 10 12" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1" y="5" width="8" height="6.5" rx="1.4" fill="#3c3c43"/><path d="M3 5V3.6a2 2 0 0 1 4 0V5" fill="none" stroke="#3c3c43" stroke-width="1.3"/></svg>qfunder.tradeling.com</span><span></span></div><div class="qf-vp"><div class="qf-pg"></div></div></div></div></article>
 </div>
</div></section><section class="ch split" id="outcome"><div class="shell">
 <div class="ch-txt"><p class="lab">Where it ended</p><h2 class="claim">Built and tested in two months.</h2>
 <p>We built the MVP and tested it with users. It did not launch, for reasons unrelated to the product work.</p></div>
 <div class="ch-media"><div class="kept"><p class="lab">Lessons</p>
  <p><b>Perfect is the enemy of good.</b> We used Shufti Pro for KYC/KYB checks and an open-source loan management system (LMS), instead of building our own. For an MVP, that is a valid design decision: test the idea first, build later.</p>
  <p><b>Trust is visual.</b> In fintech, clean design is not only about looks. If a screen looks broken or cheap, people will not trust it with their financial data.</p></div></div>
</div></section>
